window.products.push({"id":465011,"name":"ARCTIC STEEL 10oz Insulated Lowball Tumbler with Lid - Perfect for Coffee, Whiskey, and Cocktails - Durable Stainless Steel, Powder Coated Double Wall","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71OqbW4pYwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"ONE INSULATED CUP TO RULE THEM ALL - Arctic Steel's powder coated double wall vacuum insulated cup will last a lifetime, and will keep your drink ice cold down to the last drop. Perfect for whiskey, bourbon, cocktails and other liquor on the rocks. Our stainless steel mug is also perfect for hot coffee or tea while on the go and will keep it warm all day long! BPA-FREE LID INCLUDED - We all know that it's inevitable to accidentally spill your drink every once in a while. Our stainless steel tumbler comes with an Eco-Friendly and BPA-Free lid to keep your beverage in your cup and not on your clothes! Each insulated tumbler comes in a high-quality gift box so you can buy one for yourself and give a few as gifts! AIRTIGHT SEALED GASKET - The Arctic Steel tumbler with lid is a must-have during tailgating, camping, fishing, or is even great for hanging out at home! Sick of getting your cocktails watered down? No worries, our tumbler cup will hold ice all day long! It's also an awesome coffee mug that will keep your hot beverages super warm until the very last sip! MAKE IT FANCY - Our insulated tumblers come with an option to purchase with our ice ball mold. You might think that there's really no difference between using ice cubes and an ice ball, but there is! Less surface tension means less dilution! Impress your friends and make everyone ice balls for that whiskey drink or for their favorite choice cocktail! A LIFETIME OF CARE - Our lowball tumbler comes with a 30 day, no questions asked, return policy and a LIFETIME GUARANTEE when registered on our website. Did we mention that a part of all our proceeds are donated to the World Wildlife Foundation to save Arctic Polar Bears! Check out our full line of insulated drinkware and accessories today, just click Arctic Steel above.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71OqbW4pYwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ARCTIC STEEL","source_asin":"B01J96SVFQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-465011","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01J96SVFQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01J96SVFQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
