window.products.push({"id":465068,"name":"Havercamp Army Camo Birthday Party Decorations – Complete Party (6 Items)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":34.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91jhd+Wz5sL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"LARGE HAPPY BIRTHDAY BANNER – Almost 8 feet long! (7 ¾’), Cardboard letters are approx. 7” square and connected with metal grommets. Features Big Apache Helicopter where “Add an Age” numbers can be attached (1-99included). Strings included for hanging banner. Display anywhere to make your birthday event Extra Special. BIG CENTERPIECE – 14.5”Tall, 12.5”Diameter. This 3D Centerpiece is an impressive focal point at your army camo party. The honeycomb tissue and cardboard base unfolds for easy setup. The top is two Army Gold Stars that slide together for a giant 3D Star with camo border and featuring the amazing Apache helicopter. HEAVYWEIGHT PLASTIC TABLECOVER - 1 extra large (108\" x 54\") Heavyweight tablecover. A customer favorite, this tablecover is completely waterproof, wipeable, and re-usable. High quality, full-camo print. This item is a longtime customer favorite and will get re-used again and again. 2; 18 IN. FOIL BALLOONS AND Three 10 IN. PAPER LANTERNS– Fill the air at your party! The two, big balloons have the Apache Helicopter on one side and the sleek Fighter Jet on the other and can be filled with air or helium. The three paper lanterns are 10” in diameter and secured with metal frames that include hooks at the top for hanging. String them along for excellent party decorations. 24 PARTY/FOOD PICKS – Continue your theme with this mixed pack of party picks. Includes both Helicopter and Fighter Jet picks. 2 ½” tall, paper construction, great for cupcakes, sandwiches, more! Havercamp’s Authentic Military Camo Pattern is A-Tacs Camo and is used in Uniforms for Tactical Units in the U.S. Military. This collection is great for Kids and Adults—they will know this pattern is the “Real Deal”. Boys love this combat camo look. So much included in this bundle!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91jhd+Wz5sL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Havercamp","source_asin":"B0BH7V6X4Z","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-465068","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BH7V6X4Z","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BH7V6X4Z","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
