window.products.push({"id":465135,"name":"Evo Oil Sprayer Evo Green Non-Aerosol for Olive Cooking Oils 18oz, 2.3","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71D39vEqqYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Evo Non-Aerosol Oil Sprayer Bottle, the world’s first non-aerosol trigger sprayer with a unique fan-shaped spray, easily dispenses cooking oil without harmful additives, propellants or chemicals. Beautifully designed by Michael Graves Design Group (MGDG) for display right on the counter. Or, it’s slim enough to store in the fridge. Its generous 18-ounce capacity keeps the most used healthy cooking oil at the ready, like EVOO (extra virgin olive oil), canola oil, avocado oil, grapeseed oil, even infused oils with herbs and spices. Great for balsamic vinegar, lime juice, and cooking wine too. Makes preparing healthy meals and practicing portion control easier! Evo allows complete control over calories, nutrition and food purity. Every pull of the trigger delivers a precise 1. 35-milliliters in a unique fan pattern that covers more cooking surface with less oil. The scalloped trigger offers a natural ergonomic feel and secure grip. The handy screw-on funnel makes filling and changing contents easy, and hooks onto the oil container’s handle between uses. The 3 reusable, washable bands clearly identify contents. Helpful anywhere food is being prepared, cooked and served for easy indoor and outdoor lifestyle. Coat vegetables for roasting or broiling, flavor fillets for baking or steak for grilling, finish foods before serving, and apply salad dressing. Easier to use than a traditional oil vaporizer or oil mister. No pumping, priming, or messy, clogged oil dispensers! Simply fill and firmly pull the trigger for consistent, even coverage. Made from BPA-, Latex-, and DEHP-free plastic, Evo is durable, food safe and 100-percent recyclable. It won’t shatter if dropped like glass spray bottles can. More economical than aerosol cooking spray. Stores easily in the fridge. Hand wash in warm, soapy water. Includes 18-ounce sprayer bottle, ergonomic precision trigger, 3 reusable label bands, and handy twist-on funnel.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71D39vEqqYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Evo Oil Sprayer","source_asin":"B0B4PPLYM5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-465135","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B4PPLYM5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B4PPLYM5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
