window.products.push({"id":465161,"name":"DECOMOMO 13x13x13 Storage Cube Bins | Fabric Cube Storage Organizer Bins with Durable Handles for Organizing, Closet, Shelf, Cubes, Nursery (Red and W","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91D-l4Urn5S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✅ High Quality Storage: Made with 2.5mm Medium Density Fiberboard (MDF) throughout the fabric storage cubes, our cube bins are built to support all your storage needs for years. These stackable storage cube remain rigid whether full or empty and will allow you to carry more without having to worry about the sides collapse with unbalanced weight. Faux leather handles not only add a decorative touch, but also provides a strong grip while moving on and off shelves. ✅ Elegant & Decorative: Renew your look of shelves with DECOMOMO storage cubes while maximizing the space. DECOMOMO’s clean and sleek cube storage bins are designed with two exterior colors that embodies modern and simplistic styles that can match most of your home decorations and styles. Perfect decorative cubby storage bins for IKEA Kallax cube bookcases and shelves and Better Homes & Gardens furniture. ✅Large Storage Cubes: These 13x13x13 storage cube bins can store up to 36L to help maximize your space. DECOMOMO cube storage organizer bins provides a solution to many storage needs; organizing and storing nursery products, kids’ toys, pet supplies, clothes & underwear, socks, towels, toiletry storage, purse & accessories, magazines & books, supplies, etc. Our closet storage bins can be used on shelves, bedroom, living room, office, closets and cabinets and much more. ✅Fit Perfectly In Shelves: Set of 4. Dimensions (each): 13’ x 13’ x 13’ / 33cm x 33cm x 33cm. DECOMOMO's 13 inch cube storage bins are perfect bins for cube organizer including the IKea Kallax / Expedit Shelving System, Better Home and Garden (BHG) Shelving Unit (13 inch Cubie), ClosetMaid 1107, 1108, 1109, 1110 Cubicles Organizer. ✅Easy Assembly & Care Tip: Our cube organizer bins are easy to assemble. Construct the square cube bins by placing the hardbottom flat into the basket. Fabric is easy to clean, dusting the cubes with a soft dry cloth is recommended. Spot clean with light soapy water when needed. If you run into any issue or questions, please don’t hesitate to get in touch with us via Amazon. We’ll get back to you within 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91D-l4Urn5S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DECOMOMO","source_asin":"B09317FZDZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-465161","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09317FZDZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09317FZDZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
