window.products.push({"id":465188,"name":"Bestar Universel 59W Full Murphy Bed in bark Grey & White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":1859.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51WeRjNa57L._AC_SL1080_.jpg","description":"MULTIPURPOSE DESIGN: Murphy bed can be folded away into a cabinet to open up floor space in any room. A wall bed is the ideal space-saving furniture for a multi-use guest room, home office, or home gym. The Murphy bed can be slept on every night and works perfectly in a small apartment or studio. PRACTICAL WALL BED: Murphy bed’s dual piston mechanism allows the bed to fold up and down smoothly in seconds without heavy lifting. The EuroSlat mattress support system increases the sleeper’s comfort and accommodates most standard Full size mattresses (8-10” thick, 60 to 90 lb, 54” X 75”). Wall bed is easy to use; simply pull on the handles and flip the support leg down onto the floor. IDEAL FOR SMALL SPACES: Transform any room in seconds with a space-saving wall bed. Small space living becomes easy when you can fold your bed away into a cabinet during the day. When planning your space, assign a clearance of 30” to 36” around the open bed to make getting in and out of bed easier. QUALITY MATERIALS: North American made with local and imported parts. Made from commercial-grade particle board with an attractive laminate finish. Made in compliance with TSCA Title VI. Maximum weight supported is 1000 lb (including mattress). Minimum height of anchoring wall is 85.8”. When opened, the bed extends 87.3” from the wall. Not compatible with futons. Box spring not required. INSTALLATION AND NOTES: For installation and to avoid risk of injury, use only a professional or qualified person with knowledge of the wall structure, studs, and components. Bed may be attached to wood studs, metal studs, or masonry wall structures; masonry requires use of concrete screws (not provided). Assembly is required (3 people recommended). This product is not designed for children under 6 years old and/or under 50 pounds (22.7 kg). Backed by the Bestar 10 Year Manufacturer‘s Warranty.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51WeRjNa57L._AC_SL1080_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bestar","source_asin":"B07VQ52LP6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-465188","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07VQ52LP6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07VQ52LP6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
