window.products.push({"id":465216,"name":"EastArts Custom Blanket with Photos on it, Customized Blanket with Pet Picture and Text for Lover and Friends","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81HdsZT02OL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Fabric:100% microfiber polyester fabric, which is cozy Fleece fabric super comfortable. 6 sizes available: 32\"x48\", 40\"x50\", 40\"x60\", 50\"x70\", 60\"x80\", and 60\"x90\", among which, 32\"x48\" is small for family home use , but suitable for pets and as a gift just for memorial. Due to manual cutting and sewing, please allow a size difference of 1~2 inches. Custom Process: 1. Choose the size of blanket you want; 2. Click \"Customize Now\" and Follow the process. 3. Before submitting the order, you can see an approximate preview. If you need the print preview designed by us, please send a message to us, we will send it to your mailbox within 24 hours, please check and confirm in time. Sepcial Need: Please contact us if you want to print more photos on Blanket, or different blanket colour is wanted. Colour Fastnass: With cold water machine wash, the colour Printed on the blanket would not fade away for many years. Popular Gift：Our customized blanket is very popular gifts for family and friends on holiday, birthday, granduation from school, promotion in their job, etc.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81HdsZT02OL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"EastArts","source_asin":"B08VRFFC54","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-465216","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08VRFFC54","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08VRFFC54","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":465217,"name":"HISTORY COMPANY The 1930 Algonquin Round Table Cocktail Coupe Glass 2-Piece Set (Gift Box Collection)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71k4OIhihKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Best Cocktail Coupe for Serving and Entertaining. Timeless Testament to Good Taste. The 6-inch-tall stature and sleek design of the Algonquin Cocktail Glass offers a stunning visual presentation for the home dinner or cocktail party. Enjoy favorite cocktails while imagining the days of Dorothy Parker and the Algonquin Round Table, a notoriously witty group met for lunch daily at New York's Algonquin Hotel, engaging in wisecracks, witty banter, and wordplay, much of which received international attention. What made this particular literary coterie so likeable was their lack of pomposity combined with a love and lust for life. Ultimately, the cocktail is a sociable drink, and to be enjoyed in pleasant circumstances and in the finest company. Serve your guests cocktails in generous 8.5-ounce (251 ml), versatile Algonquin Cocktail Glasses for an occasion to be savored and remembered. Each Gift Box includes 2 glasses, Algonquin \"Blue Bar\" coasters, and \"The Round Table\" souvenir with recipe for the historic Algonquin Cocktail.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71k4OIhihKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HISTORY COMPANY","source_asin":"B08B46NVDV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-465217","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08B46NVDV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08B46NVDV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
