window.products.push({"id":465225,"name":"Cybrtrayd Life of the Party Bearded Santa Lolly Chocolate Candy Mold in Sealed Protective Poly Bag Imprinted with Copyrighted Cybrtrayd Molding Instru","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":4.2,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71zgdIUZMjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Become your own chocolatier with CybrTrayd’s complete line of confectionary making supplies! We offer a variety of food-grade PETG plastic molds that are durable and can be reused for a multitude of projects. Create chocolates for all occasions using our traditional shapes for cookie and cake molds or invest in more elaborate 3-D designs. Each mold is sealed in a poly bag with CybrTrayd instructions imprinted on it. This will provide details on chocolate melting and molding for all our molds, including the hollow 3-D molds. In addition, we’ve provided some tips and tricks for getting the best possible results. All of our plastic designs can also be used for soap making. Additional directions are provided soap melt & pour techniques.To prevent any damage to your mold please wash by hand and do not put it in the dishwasher. These plastic molds are not meant to be used with hard candy. The molds are not suitable for children under 3 and should only be used by older children with adult supervision.Chocolates make great favors or treats for parties and other special occasions. Use the hearts, strawberries, rose and other flowers for romantic gestures such as wedding favors or a Valentine’s Day surprise. Trees, ornaments, candy canes and other festive references are perfect for the holiday season. All of our adorable baby molds are ideal for showers and gender reveal parties. You can also add pop sticks to some of the chocolates and create lollipop celebrations.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71zgdIUZMjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CybrTrayd","source_asin":"B000EGAQNG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-465225","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000EGAQNG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000EGAQNG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":465226,"name":"Leg Elevation Pillow for After Surgery, Back, Hip and Knee Pain Relief, Improve Blood Circulation, Reduce Swelling, Alleviate Varicose Veins, Leg Ramp","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71yE-gVZjhS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"LEG ELEVATION PILLOW WITH EXCELLENT SUPPORT. This leg rest pillow provides you a 45-degree incline to elevate your legs when you relax or sleep. Help improve blood flow circulation, alleviate varicose veins, swelling and edema, relieve aches and pains in the lower back or knees, remove the pressure placed your legs, lower back and feet, allowing you to enjoy an undisturbed sleep cycle so you wake feeling more rested. CREATIVE ERGONOMIC ADJUSTABLE ELEVATION PILLOW. Our leg elevation pillow provides targeted support for your legs. With a specially designed curved ridge to cradle your calves, and comfort your knees and legs with uncompromising support that adapts and conforms to the natural shape of your body. In order to fit the majority height of different people, this leg pillow is also designed with adjustable height. PREMIUM HIGH DENSITY MEDICAL GRADE MEMORY FOAM. Each memory foam pillow features a double-layer of comfort, including 1.5 inches of high density medical grade memory foam on top and a firm foam base to provide good support and comfort. The size of this leg elevator is 24 x 16.5 x 8 inches and it's medium firm, so it could provide adequate support for people in all weight groups and they won't sink into it. LEG WEDGE PILLOW FOR AFTER SURGERY. This leg rest pillow is an effective choice of support for those looking to recuperate after leg, knee, hip or ankle surgery. It is highly conducive for reducing back, knee, leg and hip pain, alleviating post-surgery pain and varicose veins, reducing swelling, improving blood circulation, and promoting sleep. It is ideal for injury rehabilitation and healing in an elevated leg posture. REMOVABLE AND WASHABLE COVER. Each pillow features a removable pillow cover made from high-quality soft bamboo fabric that allows for comfortable rest whenever you need. The cover has a zipper, easy to be removed, and it is machine washable, also easy to be maintained.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71yE-gVZjhS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lenora","source_asin":"B091KKDWDJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-465226","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B091KKDWDJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B091KKDWDJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
