window.products.push({"id":465310,"name":"Rivama Foldable Clip Hangers with 32 Clips,Clothes Drying Rack with Clips,Folding Laundry Clip and Drip Drying Hanger for Socks,Underwear,Bras,Lingeri","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61BTJDtt+BL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"High-Quality Materials : Our clothes drying rack with 32 clips are made of High-Quality plastic, safe and environmentally friendly, strong and durable.The hanger has a smooth surface and beautiful colors. 360 Degree Rotation : 360 degree rotating neck design, you can rotate to any angle you want, so it is easy for you to remove or hang clothes from all directions. Wind-Proof Design : The wind-proof hook can prevent the clothes drying hanger from being blown away by the wind. 32 Clips : The clothes hangers has 32 non-slip teeth clips, the spring has a long life, and can hang many small objects. Note: It is not suitable for hanging heavy items. Multi-Purpose : Our 32 clip socks hangers are very suitable for hanging socks, masks, diapers, scarves, towels, underwear, baby clothes, bras, ties, hats, handkerchiefs or other small objects. You can hang the hanger on the laundry room, closet, clothesline, shower curtain rod. Foldable Space-Saving : The clothes drying rack can be folded and stored when not in use, saving your storage space. The foldable hanger is convenient to use and does not require assembly. The lightweight design is also suitable for camping, travel and vacation.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61BTJDtt+BL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Rivama","source_asin":"B08YJYMJVP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-465310","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08YJYMJVP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08YJYMJVP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":465311,"name":"Opulence Seven Chakra Crystal Tree of Life -Gemstone Bonsai Money Tree for Good Luck, Wealth & Prosperity Spiritual Gift Reiki Healing Feng Shui LG-12","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":23.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91FCFgLlYzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"There are 7 types of chakras that are spread out from the base of your spine to the top of your head First Chakra: Root Chakra . The first one is the root chakra and it is associated with the primal need for survival and security. It governs areas such as your sexual organs, the kidneys and intestines. It is represented by the color red, and it is usually the first one to suffer a hit should anything wrong with your body’s systems. Second Chakra: Sacral Chakra The second type is the sacral chakra, located just below the navel, stretching all the way down to your lower abdomen. It is represented by the color orange, and it governs organs such as the large intestines and the bladder. This chakra is responsible for sexual power, the ability to be vulnerable and creative. Third Chakra: Solar Plexus Chakra Chakra number three is the solar plexus chakra, located below the rib cage. Represented by the color yellow, this chakra provides you with a will to succeed and is home to your ego and sense of self. Fourth Chakra: Heart Chakra The fourth chakra is the heart chakra, also known as anahata. Represented by the color green, this chakra is responsible for the ability to be compassionate, loving and forgiving. It also is tied to the immune and circulatory systems, and it can help you connect with your intuition. Fifth Chakra: Throat Chakra The fifth chakra is the throat chakra, represented by the color blue. When it’s working as it should, you are able to speak your truth without fear, you are a good communicator who can hold any crowd’s attention, and you are tactful, inspiring, adventurous and loyal. Sixth Chakra: Third Eye Chakra The sixth chakra is the third eye chakra, represented by the color indigo. This chakra is responsible for fearlessness, practicality, idealism and the need to seek out the truth. Seventh Chakra: Crown Chakra it is represented by a purple flower This chakra connects you to the universal source energy and gives you an idea of the infinite nature","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91FCFgLlYzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Opulence","source_asin":"B082LZ2NZC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-465311","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B082LZ2NZC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B082LZ2NZC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
