window.products.push({"id":465375,"name":"Dehumidifier TOMERSUN 2600 Cubic Feet(280 sq ft) Small Dehumidifiers for home 35oz Mini Dehumidifier for home,Basement,Bathroom, Closet,RV,Bedroom,Kit","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":31.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61hgWmIXfwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Why do we need a dehumidifier? This small dehumidifier can help purify the air and create a clean and healthy environment for you and your family. Whether it's a kitchen, a living room, a bedroom, a basement, a bathroom, a closet or any other poorly ventilated space. Specifications Input volts: 100-240VFrequency:50HZ/60HzPower consumption: 27WDimensions: 15*12*22cmGross weight: 1.3kgMax. capacity: 35oz/1000mlWorking temperature: 41℉-104℉ How to use this small dehumidifier? One-button switch design helps you easily operate the portable dehumidifier.You only need to press the on/off button to start dehumidifying, and long press the button to switch off.When the dehumidifier is on, you can press the button to choose the LED light colors or close the LED light.When the water tank is full, the mini dehumidifier will auto-off with a Di-Di warning sound when it reaches 700-800ml and the LED light will turn red.Then you can take down the machine body and leave the water tank only, remove the rubber plug carefully and empty the water tank. Tips: 1.The dehumidification performance is affected by many factors, such as the environmental humidity, temperature, space size, airflow speed(windows or door closed or not) and so on.2.After using the mini dehumidifier, the user must turn off the unit by pressing the on/off button.3.Check that the front and top air inlet and outlet grills are not obstructed by clothing, plastic bags or papers.4.Always keep the unit upright to prevent water leakage.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61hgWmIXfwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tomersun","source_asin":"B08XM2GRS1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-465375","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08XM2GRS1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08XM2GRS1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
