window.products.push({"id":465513,"name":"penepico Green Pampas Grass Tall,6pcs 43.3\" Natural Colorful Long Pompas Floral with Dried Flower Aroma, Charming,Elegant Large Dried Plant for Living","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":46.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71uR4TPMgYL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"🌷【EXUDES A NATURAL and PLEASANT FRAGRANCE】Our green pampas grass is dyed with natural tall pampas, baked with dried flower making process. The immortal flowers retain the original flavor of the plant, exuding a natural, healthy, comfortable and slight fragrance. 🌷【LUXURIOUS LIVING ROOM DECOR, SPECIAL GREEN RETRO FARMHOUSE DECOR, EACH DIFFERENT】Our green pampas grass , cool, soft and comfortable. The total length is about 43.3\"/110cm, after strict selection, but like all natural objects in the world, the length and thickness are different . The overall visual effect is harmonious and natural. Noble and calm. 🌷【SEASONAL DECOR,SPRING OR SUMMER DECOR,ELEGANT LIVING ROOM GREEN DECORATION】 Soft, drape, flexible, tall green feather flower. The shape is as pleasing as a artwork, sways in the wind. Decoração elegante da sala. 🌷【A SMALL PORTION OF FLORETS WILL FALL OFF】Naturally, the natural pompous grass will drop slightly when it shakes violently. This is a normal phenomenon, so don't worry. Our large green pompas floral is carefully selected, most of the flower heads are relatively bushy, fluffy and clean, even if there are some small branches falling off, it does not affect the appearance, and it is still very beautiful. 🌷【100% SATISFACTION GURANTEE】Refund or replacement for free if anything goes wrong, please feel free to contact us if you have any questions. We hope to bring love and warmth to your life. Thank you!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71uR4TPMgYL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"penepico","source_asin":"B0BMG4MJNZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-465513","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BMG4MJNZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BMG4MJNZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
