window.products.push({"id":465518,"name":"Cupsco Mustache Cup 16oz 4-pack Stainless Steel","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51ghpOz6mlL._AC_.jpg","description":"When it comes to cups, only in the last century has society chosen disposability over retainability. It started with the paper Dixie cup in 1908, originally invented to avoid the spread of disease aboard railroad cars. Then came wax-coated, polystyrene, and even “compostable” plastic cups. While we no longer have to dip into communal water buckets, the disposable cup train keeps on chugging. 100 years ago single-use cups were for public health safety, and now it’s all about convenience. But at what cost to the planet, your drinking experience, and your health? Now we have the power to resist single-use drinkware altogether. To buy a retainable stainless steel cup and use it for a lifetime. To carry it with us to use wherever single-use cups might otherwise be handed our way. Now we have the chance to drink retainably! Our 4-pack contains 4 cups, each with a different mustache pad printed and heat cured for durability.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51ghpOz6mlL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cupsco","source_asin":"B00O6G068U","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-465518","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00O6G068U","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00O6G068U","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
