window.products.push({"id":465694,"name":"SMISME Drinking Heart Shaped Double Walled Insulated Glass Coffee Mugs or Tea Cups,2pack Borosilicate Glass Mug for Latte, Cappuccino with Good Grip H","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.38,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/310393tm7sL._AC_.jpg","description":"ENJOY YOUR FAVORITE DRINK! Sip on your cappuccino or scoop your whipped cream on caramel-flavored desserts in an easy, convenient manner and manage to make the experience look stylish with your lover and family . High Quality Material: Made of heat and condensation-resistant borosilicate glass, which is stronger and more durable than common glass that gives a smooth and a clear look.Safe material,babies, pregnant women also can be used safely.Double Walled Design :The double-layer glass with handle allows you to safely hold hot drinks without worrying about getting burned or slipping.FOR HOT AND COLD DRINKS: Flower tea cup can be used for coffee, tea, juice, soda, milk, lemonade, wine, cocktails, water. And this design eliminates condensation on the external glass. The insulation effect it creates keeps beverages hot or cold.Easy Clean:Wash the cups by hand and warm water easily remove the residue.PERFECT GIFT FOR LOVER: This glass tea mug suitable for gift giving and household adornment, giving mum, teacher, girlfriend, abuela, and grandma is a good choice. It is a personalized gift idea for Mother's Day, anniversary, birthday, Christmas, Wedding Graduation, Valentine's Day, business gift set. Great for wedding parties, housewarming gifts, bridesmaid gifts and much more. Specification: Material: borosilicate glass Capacity: 180 ml/ 6 oz Included: 2 pack x Double Wall Heart Shape Glass Mugs Tips: 1.It's not good for the enamel if put cups in the microwave oven and dishwasher. 2.Don't use any strongly acidic and alkaline detergent to wash it. 3.Dry naturally, avoid using the hair dryer or baking. 4.The cup is best washed by hand.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/310393tm7sL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SMISME","source_asin":"B09B2G19MM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-465694","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09B2G19MM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09B2G19MM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
